    <section class="capability-intro panel"><div class="intro-copy"><span class="intro-eyebrow"><span></span>面向业务，逐步构建</span><h2>让每一项能力，<br />都有清晰的数据前提。</h2><p>先验证业务价值，再按授权接入数据。<br />所有能力保留人工确认与可追溯的辅助依据。</p></div><div class="architecture-flow"><div class="architecture-node"><span><Database :size="23" /></span><strong>授权数据</strong><small>最小必要 · 分级访问</small></div><div class="flow-connector"><i></i><ChevronRight :size="14" /></div><div class="architecture-node core"><span><Network :size="25" /></span><strong>辅助分析</strong><small>本地规则 · 私有化预留</small></div><div class="flow-connector"><i></i><ChevronRight :size="14" /></div><div class="architecture-node"><span><ShieldCheck :size="24" /></span><strong>人工确认</strong><small>依据可溯 · 全程留痕</small></div></div><div class="intro-stat"><strong>06</strong><span>拓展业务场景</span><div><i></i>{{ demoCount ? `已体验 ${demoCount} 项样例` : '全部支持交互预览' }}</div></div></section>
    <div class="capability-section-title"><div><h2>围绕监督工作的六个方向</h2><span>点击卡片，查看业务边界与可交互规则样例。</span></div><div class="legend"><span><i></i>本期规则样例</span><span><i></i>二期能力预览</span></div></div>
    <div class="capability-grid"><button v-for="capability in capabilities" :key="capability.id" class="capability-card panel" @click="open(capability)"><div class="capability-card-top"><span class="capability-icon" :class="capability.color"><component :is="capability.icon" :size="24" /></span><span class="capability-status" :class="{ preview: capability.tag.includes('二期') }"><i></i>{{ capability.tag }}</span></div><h3>{{ capability.title }}</h3><p>{{ capability.description }}</p><div class="capability-io"><div><span>业务输入</span><strong>{{ capability.input }}</strong></div><div><span>辅助产出</span><strong>{{ capability.output }}</strong></div></div><div class="capability-card-footer"><span><LockKeyhole :size="12" />正式接入需授权</span><span>查看能力<ArrowRight :size="14" /></span></div></button></div>
    <section class="phase-roadmap panel"><div class="roadmap-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">从业务验证到授权协同</span><h2>分期实施建议</h2></div><p>以下为能力演进路径建议，不代表实际建设排期。</p></div><div class="phase-list"><div class="phase"><span class="phase-dot active"><Check :size="12" /></span><div class="phase-label">第一阶段<span>业务验证</span></div><h3>高频场景先行</h3><p>信访辅助 · 巡察阅卷<br />文书校核 · 法规助手</p><span class="phase-tag current">本期演示重点</span></div><div class="phase"><span class="phase-dot">02</span><div class="phase-label">第二阶段<span>规则深化</span></div><h3>数据与任务贯通</h3><p>农村三资 · 收支对账规则<br />任务督办 · 业务能力扩展</p><span class="phase-tag">本期含三资规则演示</span></div><div class="phase"><span class="phase-dot">03</span><div class="phase-label">第三阶段<span>授权协同</span></div><h3>拓展关联监督</h3><p>跨部门授权数据比对<br />关联监督 · 私有化部署</p><span class="phase-tag">须另行授权与评估</span></div></div></section>
    <div class="capability-boundary"><ShieldCheck :size="15" /><span>本期均使用虚构演示数据。能力预览不代表已接入真实业务系统；正式建设须完成数据授权、规则验证与人工审核流程。</span></div>

    <Teleport to="body"><div v-if="active" class="capability-backdrop" @click.self="active = null"><aside class="capability-drawer"><div class="drawer-top"><span>能力详情</span><button aria-label="关闭能力详情" @click="active = null"><X :size="21" /></button></div><div class="drawer-heading"><span class="drawer-icon"><component :is="active.icon" :size="28" /></span><div><h2>{{ active.title }}</h2><span>{{ active.phase }}</span></div></div><div class="drawer-tabs"><button :class="{ active: drawerTab === 'overview' }" @click="drawerTab = 'overview'">能力与数据边界</button><button :class="{ active: drawerTab === 'demo' }" @click="drawerTab = 'demo'">交互规则样例<span>演示</span></button></div><div class="drawer-body"><template v-if="drawerTab === 'overview'"><div class="drawer-description">{{ active.detail }}</div><div class="capability-detail-block"><div><Database :size="17" /><h3>业务输入</h3></div><p>{{ active.input }}</p></div><div class="capability-detail-block"><div><Sparkles :size="17" /><h3>可产生的辅助产物</h3></div><p>{{ active.output }}</p></div><div class="access-requirement"><LockKeyhole :size="19" /><div><h3>数据接入前提</h3><p>{{ active.access }}</p></div></div><div class="data-boundary-steps"><div><Check :size="13" />虚构样本规则已可交互</div><div><CircleDot :size="13" />真实数据接入需单独授权</div><div><CircleDot :size="13" />业务规则需主管人员验证</div></div><button class="btn btn-primary preview-start" @click="drawerTab = 'demo'"><GitCompareArrows :size="16" />体验本地规则样例<ArrowRight :size="15" /></button></template><template v-else><div class="demo-disclaimer"><ShieldCheck :size="16" /><span>仅处理当前虚构文本 · 未连接任何真实业务库</span></div><div class="demo-input-label"><label for="capability-input">演示输入</label><button @click="input = active.sample">恢复样例</button></div><textarea id="capability-input" v-model="input" spellcheck="false"></textarea><div class="demo-input-hint">可编辑记录，使用“|”分隔字段，每行一条。首行为表头。</div><button class="btn btn-primary run-comparison" :disabled="processing || !input.trim()" @click="compare"><GitCompareArrows :size="16" />{{ processing ? '正在比对演示记录…' : result ? '重新运行规则比对' : '运行规则比对' }}</button><div v-if="result" class="comparison-result"><div class="comparison-heading"><CheckCheck :size="18" /><h3>辅助比对结果</h3><span>演示结果</span></div><div v-for="(line, index) in resultLines" :key="index" class="comparison-block"><strong>{{ line.split('\n')[0] }}</strong><p>{{ line.split('\n').slice(1).join('\n') }}</p></div><button class="btn review-capability" :class="{ confirmed: result.reviewed }" :disabled="!!result.reviewed" @click="confirmReview"><Check :size="15" />{{ result.reviewed ? '已人工查看结果与边界' : '人工确认已查看结果与边界' }}</button></div><div v-else class="comparison-empty"><ClipboardList :size="31" /><h3>把规则依据呈现出来</h3><p>运行比对后，查看来源记录、命中规则和待核问题。</p></div></template></div><div class="drawer-footer"><ShieldCheck :size="15" /><span>疑点不等于事实。所有结论与后续处理均需人工核查。</span></div></aside></div></Teleport>
  </div>
</template>

